<h1>About Me</h1>

<section id="bio">
  <h2>Bio</h2>
  <p>I&rsquo;m an undergraduate <strong>Computer Science</strong> student with a soft
    spot for the web: the fact that a browser tab can be a drawing tool, a game, or
    a tiny research paper all at once still feels a little bit like magic to me.
    Most of what I build starts as a <i>&ldquo;wait, could I actually make
    this?&rdquo;</i> side project.</p>
  <p>Day to day I work mostly in <b>JavaScript</b>, <b>Python</b>, and <b>SQL</b>,
    and I&rsquo;m spending this course specifically getting more comfortable writing
    HTML and CSS by hand instead of leaning on a framework to hide it from me.</p>
  <p>B.S. Computer Science, in progress<br>
    Expected graduation: 2027</p>
</section>

