<section id="approach">
  <h2>How I Approach a Project</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Understand the actual problem before opening an editor</li>
    <li>Sketch the smallest version that could possibly work</li>
    <li>Build that version, end to end, before polishing anything</li>
    <li>Iterate based on real testing, not guesses</li>
